{"id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-decidable-set.md","title":"Decidable Set","display":"df-decidable-set — Decidable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-decidable-set","aliases":["92-df-decidable-set"],"display":"df-decidable-set — Decidable Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-decidable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-decidable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decidable-set — Decidable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecSet}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecSet}\\)</span> (recursive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> (definition-target decidability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RecSet}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RecSet}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>是可判定集</li>\n<li>可判定集的特征函数是递归函数</li>\n<li>存在算法能判定任意<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>是否属于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span></li>\n<li>可判定集 = 递归集</li>\n<li>在含有足够算术的系统（如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>）中，可判定关系可由相应表示定理表示；这需要理论强度与编码条件，不是本定义单独推出的结论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecSet}$ (recursive-set predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RecSet}(A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":950,"backlinks":[{"id":"58c4ff1898820e8c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5984f0527f1f4cba","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dec}$ (decidable-set predicate, see [[92-df-decidable-set]])"},{"id":"d3233